  "steps": [
    "For bread crumbs - grind 1 slice whole wheat bread.",
    "Boil soya chunks and squeeze them well until all water is drained out.",
    "In a pan, add ghee and sauté garlic, chilli and jeera.",
    "Add onion, corn and sauté until golden brown.",
    "Add masalas and mix well.",
    "Blend this along with rice flour and soya chunks.",
    "Apply ghee on your hands and roll into cutlets while stuffing small cubes of cheese in each cutlet.",
    "Roll into bread crumbs and pan fry on each side until crispy. (May take 15 mins on med-low flame)",
    "For chutney - handful dhaniya, 1 tbsp greek yogurt, 1-2 walnuts, 1/2 green chilli, 1 garlic clove, 1/2 lemon juice, salt and pepper - blend everything together and its ready!!"
  ],
